{"id": "unknown-2026-08-11-023", "date": "2026-08-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Canada has launched a discount scheme for the transport of steel products", "content": "<p>Canada has launched a programme worth 100 million Canadian dollars ($71.7 million) to reduce domestic steel transport costs. This is according to a statement from the country’s federal government. The Raw Materials Sector Support Programme began on 10 August. Under the programme, shippers will be reimbursed 50 per cent of the costs for relevant rail [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://gmk.center/en/news/canada-has-launched-a-discount-scheme-for-the-transport-of-steel-products/\" data-wp", "sources": [{"name": "gmk_center", "url": "https://gmk.center/en/news/canada-has-launched-a-discount-scheme-for-the-transport-of-steel-products/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "baosteel-2026-08-11-024", "date": "2026-08-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 33, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["baosteel"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Baosteel is raising its prices for flat steel products for September sales", "content": "<p>China’s Baoshan Iron &#38; Steel (Baosteel) has raised its prices for hot-rolled coils (HRC) and hot-dip galvanised steel (HDGI) for September sales on the domestic market, according to BigMint. The increase amounted to 50 yuan per tonne ($7/t) compared with the previous month. This move is likely driven by expectations of increased restocking by end-users [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://gmk.center/en/news/baosteel-is-raising-its-prices-for-flat-steel-products-for-september-sales/\"", "sources": [{"name": "gmk_center", "url": "https://gmk.center/en/news/baosteel-is-raising-its-prices-for-flat-steel-products-for-september-sales/", "type": "rss"}]}
